# Errors Logging

- Expected failures → typed result or typed error; mapped to plain-language messages in `{{lib/errors.ts}}` with a next step.
- Unexpected → `{{Sentry.captureException}}` with ids, never personal data; user sees a calm message and a retry.
- Server: fail closed — an error never grants access.

## Never
- `console.log` in app code
- stack traces to users
- empty catch blocks
